ip, timestamps, and allocation metadata.","The lifecycle collector confirms platform, boot, sockets, failed-service state, temporary-file inventory, and package health, but task-specific principals and keytabs rely on executor-captured command output.","The short-lived transfer endpoints were not independently monitored for access by other hosts, so the practical extent of their temporary exposure cannot be established."]}
